<h1>Orders</h1>

<p>Monitor incoming orders and fulfillment progress.</p>

<section>
    <h2>Order workflow</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Review new order submissions.</li>
        <li>Confirm availability and schedule production.</li>
        <li>Mark orders as in production or ready.</li>
        <li>Close orders after delivery confirmation.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Team reminders</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Check allergen notes before production.</li>
        <li>Coordinate with delivery partners on timing.</li>
    </ul>
</section>
